              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Scott J. Forster, the discharge provision of \u00a7\u202f924(c) carries a requirement of intent."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "df54ad0cd6252e33e73d84728290acc531876ba010acd1486a863993b824b19c",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-df54ad0cd625-0001-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 20,
                "start": 20
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, the discharge must occur during and in relation to the bank robbery."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "df54ad0cd6252e33e73d84728290acc531876ba010acd1486a863993b824b19c",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-df54ad0cd625-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 39,
                "start": 39
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, congress intended that an intentional discharge should be punished by a 20\u2011year mandatory minimum."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioner Position",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": "The petitioner argues that the discharge provision requires intent, must occur during the robbery, and that Congress intended an intentional discharge to carry a 20\u2011year penalty.",
      "summary_citations": [
        {
          "document_hash": "df54ad0cd6252e33e73d84728290acc531876ba010acd1486a863993b824b19c",
